; Regression test for issue #3327: a lot price rounded from its cost books
; no residue.
;
; 3 ABC bought for $10.00 have a lot price of $3.333333, so on the day they
; were bought they are worth $9.999999.  The missing millionth of a dollar
; is rounding, not a loss, and is not booked.  The rise to $4.00 that
; follows is a gain of 3 x $4.00 - $10.00 = $2.00.

2024-01-01 Buy
    Assets:Broker    3 ABC @@ $10.00
    Assets:Cash

P 2024-02-01 ABC $4.00

2024-03-01 Interest
    Assets:Cash       $1.00
    Income:Interest

test bal -V --unrealized --end 2024/02/01
                   0  Assets
              $10.00    Broker
             $-10.00    Cash
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01
               $3.00  Assets
              $12.00    Broker
              $-9.00    Cash
              $-2.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
              $-1.00  Income:Interest
--------------------
                   0
end test
